Job description
Primary Responsibilities:
• Design, develop, and maintain high quality crash free Android application using modern Android technologies.
• Build end-to-end mobile solutions from requirement analysis to deployment.
• Develop scalable, reusable, and maintainable code following Android best practices.
• Define and Implement application architecture using MVVM and Clean Architecture principles.
• Write unit, integration, and UI tests to endure application reliability.
• Integrate external hardware devices into Android application using Bluetooth APIs.
• Ensure application security and compliance with mobile security standards.
• Optimize application performance, startup time, memory usage and battery consumption.
• Troubleshoot QA/UAT/Prod issues and improve application stability.
• Collaborate with Tech Lead and Product owner to understand the requirements.

Mandatory Skills:
• Programming Language: Kotlin (Expert)
• Android UI Development: Jetpack compose, Material Design3, ViewBinding/DataBinding.
• Android Architecture: MVVM, Repository Pattern, Clean Architecture, SOLID Principles.
• Jetpack Components: ViewModel, Lifecycle, Navigation Component, CameraX, WorkManager, Media3, Bluetooth API.
• Asynchronous programming: Kotlin Coroutines, Flow, StateFlow, SharedFlow.
• Dependency Injection: Hilt, Koin.
• Local Data Management: Room DB, DataStore (secure preferences and Proto).
• Security: Android Keystore, Encrpted/Decrypted storage.
• Testing: Junit, Compose UI, Roboelectric, Instrumentation.
• Performance Optimization: Memory Leak Analysis, Android Profiler, R8/Progaurd.
• Build & Development Tools: Android Studio, Gradle, Gradle Kotlin DSL.
• Strong understanding of the Android Permissions framework, including runtime permissions and modern Activity Result API.
• Experience handling API level differences, backward compatibility, and feature gating using AndroidX libraries.

Desirable Skills:
• Awareness of Java programming.
• Offline only application development.
• Good to know Cordova based application using Java Script.
• Good knowledge on confluence.
• Familiar to Agile/Scrum and code reviews.
• AI/ML integration.
• Build and maintain CI/CD pipelines and automated deployments.

